ly disabled calendar."},"213":{"id":"/docs/components/calendar-30","page_id":"/docs/components/calendar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/calendar#accessibility","content":"Arrow keys move by day; PageUp/PageDown by month; Home/End to row edges"},"214":{"id":"/docs/components/calendar-31","page_id":"/docs/components/calendar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/calendar#accessibility","content":"Focus-visible outline; disabled days are not focusable"},"215":{"id":"/docs/components/calendar-32","page_id":"/docs/components/calendar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/calendar#accessibility","content":"Out-of-month days render at reduced opacity and are not selectable"},"216":{"id":"/docs/components/calendar-33","page_id":"/docs/components/calendar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/calendar#best-practices","content":"Always provide an `aria-label` on standalone calendars."},"217":{"id":"/docs/components/calendar-34","page_id":"/docs/components/calendar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/calendar#best-practices","content":"Use `isDateUnavailable` for scattered disabled days; use `minValue` / `maxValue` for contiguous bounds."},"218":{"id":"/docs/components/calendar-35","page_id":"/docs/components/calendar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/calendar#troubleshooting","content":"Dates not formatting per locale? Ensure the app is wrapped in `<I18nProvider locale=\"…\">`."},"219":{"id":"/docs/components/carousel","page_id":"/docs/components/carousel","type":"page","content":"Carousel","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/carousel"},"220":{"id":"/docs/components/carousel-0","page_id":"/docs/components/carousel","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/carousel","content":"The Carousel component allows users to cycle through a series of content panels (typically images, cards, or text) in a horizontal or vertical layout. It is commonly used for featured co